{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月13日 10:20 星期五</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>昨日（12日）傍晚6時許，一名男子向警方報案，聲稱在柴灣興華邨卓華樓一單位，持刀斬傷母親。警員到場發現63歲姓盧女事主的頭、頸及手受傷，並在屋內檢獲兩把分別長約25厘米及27厘米的菜刀。女事主清醒送往東區醫院救治。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>警方經初步調查，相信盧與兒子在單位內因瑣事爭執，遭對方持刀襲擊。其31歲姓黃兒子，涉嫌傷人被捕，案件交由東區警區重案組跟進。據悉，事件涉及金錢問題。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕傷人 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:43:48.644899+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T02:20:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:30.558176+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T02:37:21.376171+00:00","content_hash":"88612f66ac6c1e34992827d72fae75bdd2029c1e82861dec1604005de8512985","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}